            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You can manipulate the acoustics around you to deflect sonic damage back at its source. Attempt a Performance check against the Will DC of the creature or Fortitude DC of a hazard. If the damage came from a spell, use the creature's spell DC if it's lower.\n\n- **Critical Success:** You reduce the triggering damage by an amount up to four times your level. The creature takes sonic damage equal to the amount of damage you reduced in this way.\n- **Success:** As critical success, but you reduce the triggering damage by an amount up to twice your level."
            }
          }
        }
